center]4]<b>Experience the Epic Tokyo Travel Plan you’ll Love!</b> 

center]Check the full guide here: https://itimaker.com/blog/tokyo-itinerary 

Tokyo perfectly fuses ancient temples with glass towers, promising an remarkable journey in 2025. Use our carefully curated five-day schedule to maximize your stay. 

]Day 1 – Temples, Parks &amp; Skytree 
Begin at the iconic Asakusa shrine, wander Nakamise Street for street bites, then relax in leafy Ueno Park. Cap the evening atop the 634 m Skytree for jaw-dropping views. 

]Day 2 – Tsukiji, Harajuku &amp; More 
Rise early at Tokyo’s seafood haven to taste melt-in-your-mouth sashimi. Make your way to youthful Harajuku lanes for trendy boutiques. 

]Culture Trip – Ueno to Ginza 
Immerse yourself in historic exhibits, then treat yourself in Ginza. Finish with Roppongi art spaces for a aesthetic finale. 

]Day 4 – Imperial Majesty &amp; Tower Views 
Stroll the Imperial Palace grounds, record reels at Nijubashi Bridge, then ascend Tokyo Tower for far-reaching cityscapes. 

]Day 5 – Onsen, Tea &amp; Yanaka 
Wrap up with an onsen soak in Tokyo Bay’s Odaiba, practice a traditional tea service, and explore heritage streets of Yanaka before you depart. 

